      "message": "Seems like we could change `to_service_specific_error` to accept a `Response` directly, reducing a bit of duplicated code. Beware, I probably have bugs here (editing code in gerrit is messy business!)\n\n```\nfn to_service_specific_error(response: Response) -\u003e BinderResult\u003cVec\u003cu8\u003e\u003e {\n    match response {\n        Response::Err(e) \u003d\u003e match e {\n            RequestProcessingError::InvalidMac \u003d\u003e {\n                Status::new_service_specific_error_str(STATUS_INVALID_MAC, Some(format!(\"{e}\")))\n            }\n            _ \u003d\u003e Status::new_service_specific_error_str(\n                STATUS_FAILED,\n                Some(format!(\"Failed to process request: {e}.\")),\n            ),\n        }\n        other \u003d\u003e Err(Status::new_service_specific_error_str(\n            STATUS_FAILED,\n            Some(\"Incorrect response type: {other:?}\"),\n        )),\n    }\n}\n```\n\nThen the response processing for each caller gets simpler, e.g.\n\n```\nmatch res {\n    Response::GenerateCertificateRequest(res) \u003d\u003e Ok(res),\n    _ \u003d\u003e to_service_specific_error(res),\n}\n```",
